---
layout: page-shell.njk
title: Apply - Penta Housing Co-Op
permalink: /apply.html
---
<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <header class="text-center mb-12"><h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Apply for Membership</h1><p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Join our cooperative housing community in Vancouver. We're a member-owned housing cooperative that provides affordable, sustainable housing while fostering community connections. Our residents participate in governance and share in maintaining our beautiful property together.</p></header>
    <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6 md:p-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-6">
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-4"><svg class="h-12 w-12 {% if site.applicationsOpen %}text-green-600{% else %}text-gray-500{% endif %}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>
        {% if site.applicationsOpen %}
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-green-600">Applications Are Open!</h2><p class="text-lg text-gray-600">We're currently accepting applications for available units</p>
        {% else %}
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-700">Applications Are Currently Closed</h2><p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Subscribe below to be notified when applications reopen.</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-lg p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-4">Current Available Unit</h3><dl class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm"><div><dt class="inline font-medium">Unit Type:</dt> <dd class="inline">{{ site.unitListing.type }}</dd></div><div><dt class="inline font-medium">Monthly Housing Charge:</dt> <dd class="inline">{{ site.unitListing.monthlyHousingCharge }}</dd></div><div><dt class="inline font-medium">Move-in Date:</dt> <dd class="inline">{{ site.unitListing.moveInDate }}</dd></div><div><dt class="inline font-medium">Application Deadline:</dt> <dd class="inline">{{ site.unitListing.applicationDeadline }}</dd></div><div class="md:col-span-2"><dt class="inline font-medium">Household Requirements:</dt> <dd class="inline">{{ site.unitListing.householdRequirements }}</dd></div></dl></div>
        {% if site.applicationsOpen %}
        <div class="text-center"><a href="{{ site.applicationFormUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-open-application data-analytics-skip-external class="inline-flex items-center bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 text-white text-lg px-8 py-3 rounded-md font-medium"><svg class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M21 14v6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h6"/></svg>Complete Application Form</a><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">Opens in a new tab</p></div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-lg p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">{% if site.applicationsOpen %}Don't Qualify for This Unit?{% else %}Stay Updated{% endif %}</h3><p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Join our mailing list to be notified when units matching your preferences become available</p>{% include "email-signup.njk" %}</div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
